---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import LegalHeader from '../components/LegalHeader.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Accessibility Statement | Yahor Darashkevich"
  description="Accessibility Statement for Yahor Darashkevich portfolio website."
>
  <LegalHeader />
  <main class="py-20 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl border p-8 md:p-12" style="background-color: var(--color-surface); border-color: var(--color-border); box-shadow: 0 16px 38px var(--color-shadow);">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-4 tracking-tight">Accessibility Statement</h1>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-text-soft)] mb-10">Effective date: May 8, 2026</p>

        <div class="space-y-8 text-[var(--color-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">1. Commitment</h2>
            <p>
              This website is designed and maintained to support inclusive access for all visitors, including people
              using assistive technologies.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">2. Standards Targeted</h2>
            <p>
              The site is developed with the goal of conforming to WCAG 2.1 Level AA best practices and related
              accessibility obligations that may apply in relevant jurisdictions.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">3. Accessibility Features</h2>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
              <li>Keyboard-focus visibility and keyboard-accessible navigation.</li>
              <li>Skip-to-content link and semantic page landmarks.</li>
              <li>Accessible names for primary interactive controls.</li>
              <li>Responsive layout designed for zoom and smaller viewports.</li>
              <li>Reduced-motion support for users who prefer less animation.</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">4. Ongoing Testing</h2>
            <p>
              Accessibility is reviewed periodically through manual checks and automated linting/audit tooling during
              development and pre-release verification.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">5. Feedback and Support</h2>
            <p>
              If you experience an accessibility barrier on this website, please report it by email with the page URL,
              issue details, and any assistive technology used:
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3">
              <a class="text-[var(--color-primary)] underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-[var(--color-icon)]" href="mailto:yahor@darashkevich.com">
                yahor@darashkevich.com
              </a>
            </p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
